# Derived from coaching-mcp v3.9.2 (workspace-template/host/crontab.example), MIT.
# Install with `crontab -e` as the workspace user. Replace /path/to/workspace and /path/to/autosave.sh.
# Times are in the system timezone (`timedatectl`). Debian's cron ignores CRON_TZ, so set the system
# timezone to the user's instead of relying on it. cron's PATH is minimal: set COACHCTL_BIN and
# CLAUDE_BIN in scripts/routines/config.env to absolute paths.

# Safety net: commit and push what a dead session left behind (only when the repo has a remote).
*/30 * * * * /path/to/autosave.sh /path/to/workspace >/dev/null 2>&1

# One line per routine; the name is a prompt file scripts/routines/<name>.md. Space starts a few
# minutes apart.
# 45 7 * * *  /path/to/workspace/scripts/run_routine.sh readiness
# 0 18 * * 0  /path/to/workspace/scripts/run_routine.sh weekly-review
